# 6. Application Overview

The project is a Flask-based Student Management System.

The application provides CRUD functionality for student records.

The main operations include:

* Add student
* View students
* Update student
* Delete student
* Connect to MongoDB
* Check application health

The application also exposes a health-check endpoint:

```text
/health
```

A successful response is:

```json
{
  "status": "healthy"
}
```

This endpoint is used by the CI/CD pipeline to verify that the deployed application is running correctly.

